  "notes": "Antelope County (APA report CO02, FY ended 2023-06-30). Cash basis; governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Cash basis fund balances go to *_fund_balance; ending_cash is the printed Cash and Cash Equivalents (p3); beginning cash is not printed (null). Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement p3 (totals equal the government-wide Statement of Net Position p1). General Fund budget schedule 'Taxes' 7,855,603 (p5) split using the General Fund column of p4 (Property 6,978,793 + Motor Vehicle 457,735 + Nameplate Capacity 363,761 + Other 55,314). Nonmajor funds: line detail taken from the combining statement (pp11-13), one line per fund column; the nonmajor budget schedules (pp8-10) print only receipts/disbursements totals and are not recorded (no double counting). Drug Law Enforcement and Education Fund and Canine Fund had no activity. Noxious Weed Control (printed under Public Works) categorized natural resources/conservation per user rule. Read pages 1-13 of 13"
}
